{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-25","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-rogue-25"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-25-talk-403811920-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-25","missionId":"event-rogue-25","mission":"살 (2)","scene":"살 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"모텔 지하실에서 또 한 번 살과 마주친다. 빨간색 *악마* 더듬이가 달린 머리 아래, 끈적한 몸이 모텔의 바닥과 벽을 부식시키며 집어삼키고 있다. 당신에겐 별 관심 없는 그는 지금 몸집을 불리는 데에만 집중하고 있다","talkId":403811920,"textHash":"14987738811154503138","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:25/talk-403811920","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"6ba67c40cfdcbaf3","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-25-talk-403811921-line"],"bwikiPage":"萨里（其二）","bwikiRevision":58254,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9303","bwikiMission":"살 (2)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-25-talk-403811921-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-25","missionId":"event-rogue-25","mission":"살 (2)","scene":"살 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"어느 방에서도 인기척이 전혀 느껴지지 않는다. 객실 손님들이 침대 위에 있는 건지, 아니면 이미 살의 위 속에 있는 건지 의심스럽다…. 당신은 아까 내렸던 결정이 후회되기 시작한다","talkId":403811921,"textHash":"8877335822819532746","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:25/talk-403811921","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"6ba67c40cfdcbaf3","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"萨里（其二）","bwikiRevision":58254,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9303","bwikiMission":"살 (2)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-25-text-1481662665287727020-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-25","missionId":"event-rogue-25","mission":"살 (2)","scene":"살 (2)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"레오의 인격으로 전환하고 랜덤 기물 1개를 획득한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"1481662665287727020","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:25/text-1481662665287727020","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"db26d10221e19a4f","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"萨里（其二）","bwikiRevision":58254,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9303","bwikiMission":"살 (2)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-25-text-12644821429108321955-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-25","missionId":"event-rogue-25","mission":"살 (2)","scene":"살 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"레오를 나오게 한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"12644821429108321955","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:25/text-12644821429108321955","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"aa97d794caa84fe6","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-25-text-15716742717588671275-effect"],"bwikiPage":"萨里（其二）","bwikiRevision":58254,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9303","bwikiMission":"살 (2)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-25-text-15716742717588671275-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-25","missionId":"event-rogue-25","mission":"살 (2)","scene":"살 (2)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"살과 레오의 인격을 초기화한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"15716742717588671275","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:25/text-15716742717588671275","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"aa97d794caa84fe6","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"萨里（其二）","bwikiRevision":58254,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9303","bwikiMission":"살 (2)","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-25-text-12644821429108321955-choice"]}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-25-talk-403811920-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-25-talk-403811921-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-25-text-1481662665287727020-effect","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-25-text-12644821429108321955-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-25-text-15716742717588671275-effect"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":5,"reviewRows":0,"segments":3,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}